      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 2.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "hi sit anywhere you like"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.4,
      "end_seconds": 4.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "hello, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.44,
      "end_seconds": 9.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "so what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.42,
      "end_seconds": 23.09,
      "duration_seconds": 12.67,
      "text": "I've been dealing with not opening my bowels. I took the morning off to come in today. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.65,
      "end_seconds": 27.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.07,
      "end_seconds": 32.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "It's lactulose, 15 ml, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.95,
      "end_seconds": 47.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.45,
      "end_seconds": 51.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "for about a month, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.43,
      "end_seconds": 57.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "any black stools, passing wind or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.32,
      "end_seconds": 61.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.12,
      "end_seconds": 66.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.13,
      "end_seconds": 69.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.42,
      "end_seconds": 89.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.98,
      "end_seconds": 93.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.37,
      "end_seconds": 97.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.67,
      "end_seconds": 101.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.01,
      "end_seconds": 106.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "alright, what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.49,
      "end_seconds": 113.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.9,
      "end_seconds": 125.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.84,
      "end_seconds": 132.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.32,
      "end_seconds": 137.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.35,
      "end_seconds": 148.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.55,
      "end_seconds": 153.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.53,
      "end_seconds": 160.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "no, I'm not allergic to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.9,
      "end_seconds": 182.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.28,
      "end_seconds": 197.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.35,
      "end_seconds": 220.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 84 beats a minute, BP is 112 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.31,
      "end_seconds": 224.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.42,
      "end_seconds": 228.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.49,
      "end_seconds": 233.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Alright, now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.28,
      "end_seconds": 236.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "okay doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.08,
      "end_seconds": 239.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.36,
      "end_seconds": 252.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "there is firm stool in the left lower abdomen and no mass"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.44,
      "end_seconds": 267.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.55,
      "text": "right, please sit back down let me tell you where I've got to i think we're dealing with constipation, possibly related to diet or medicines at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.98,
      "end_seconds": 272.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.38,
      "end_seconds": 300.79,
      "duration_seconds": 27.41,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now constipation, possibly related to diet or medicines is my leading thought, not anything worse. A blood count is what I'd like next, for constipation. What I'm giving you is macrogol, 1 sachet, once a day, for two weeks. That's for constipation. More fibre, plenty of water and a regular time on the toilet after breakfast"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.39,
      "end_seconds": 316.09,
      "duration_seconds": 14.7,
      "text": "I'm not ordering blood tests today. If things carry on in a month, we'll consider it. Please don't wait if you are unable to pass wind or have severe tummy pain. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.75,
      "end_seconds": 318.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Okay makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.92,
      "end_seconds": 326.39,
      "duration_seconds": 7.47,
      "text": "See me again if it isn't working in a week. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.69,
      "end_seconds": 330.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "no that's all thanks a lot"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.15,
      "end_seconds": 332.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
